        "name": "Guile",
        "atLevel": 1,
        "description": "At 1st level, a trickster relies on her intellect as much as her personality. She adds her Intelligence modifier on Bluff, Diplomacy, Disguise, and Sense Motive checks.\n\nThis ability replaces trapfinding.\nSheet reference: apply conditional effects manually; record weapon, skill, feat, companion and spell subchoices on existing sheet rows.",
