      {
        "id": "ffd20:archetype:thief:trickster:feature:charm",
        "name": "Charm",
        "atLevel": 3,
        "description": "At 3rd level, a trickster can use [*charm*](https://www.finalfantasyd20.com/magic/spells/c/charm/) once per day as a spell-like ability (caster level equal to her thief level \u2013 2 and uses her Intelligence modifier). At 6th level, and every three levels thereafter, the trickster gains an additional daily use of this ability.\n\nThis ability replaces danger sense.\nSheet reference: apply conditional effects manually; record weapon, skill, feat, companion and spell subchoices on existing sheet rows.",
